# SYNTHETIC INPUT: nothing here is from the recording and nothing is the owner's input.
# Written by the planner on 12 October 2026: for a run that is started on a map directly
# (`gate3 run -- ... +map <name>`), where no menu is clicked: only the one tap of the space
# bar that the loading screen waits for (continue.script's second section, unchanged).
# Times are milliseconds after the anchor fired.

anchor mark mission-frame
5000 key down 32
5120 key up 32
